      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَنُو ثَقِيفٍ يَتَفَتَّنُونَ أَبَدًا</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَتَحَارَبُونَ</span> [i. e.
<i>The sons of Thakeef</i> (the tribe so called) <i>contend
in war, one with another, ever</i>]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَتَّنَنِى</span>: see 5
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عجب</span>, where it is said to be syn. with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصَبَّانِى</span>.

